3. No resale
No recipient may require a payment, subscription, fee, or other mandatory
consideration in exchange for giving or licensing another person a copy
of the Software or a modified/derivative version, whether as source code,
an executable, a download, an installer, or a paid software bundle.
A modified version must not be offered for sale either.
Selling copies or licenses requires separate written authorization from
the rights holder.

This prohibition concerns the sale or paid transfer of the Software
itself, NOT ordinary commercial use. A person may charge for independent
services such as training, consulting, setup, hosting, maintenance, or
custom development, provided the charge is not a condition for obtaining
a copy or license of the Software (including modifications) and is not
a disguised sale of the Software.

4. Redistribution and modifications
Recipients may redistribute unchanged or modified copies only free of
charge, while preserving the copyright notices, this license, and an
